   "source_notes": "Old hosting. 2026-11-19: the population figure here (227,612) comes from title=\"Vesta\", which is a CONTAINS match on the panel's page title (<title>Vesta - Login</title>) and is NOT verified - urlscan shows the same string matching unrelated sites such as vesta-partners.ch.  It needs a probe before it is used as an exposure figure.  Precise markers, from the source: http.body=\"vesta_logo.png\" (the login page references /images/vesta_logo.png), title=\"Vesta - Login\", or http.header.server=\"nginx\" && port=8083.  The panel listens on 8083 and the stock firewall opens it to 0.0.0.0/0.  ZoomEye is currently returning 402 credits_insufficient, so the census could not be re-run or probed today.  Workspace: /root/VestaCP-RCE-2026t/docs/VESTACP.md",
